WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.520
Flonyald is a land fraught with battles...

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.090
A "Hero summoned" as the savior of Biscotti...

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:10.360
...Sink Izumi, a young boy from Earth…

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.800
...has graciously agreed to help the country and

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.030
his first battle as a hero is just about to begin!

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.530
Umm, was that okay?

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.640
It was perfect, Princess!

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:01.100
The First battle!!

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.100
The... The...

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.060
The Hero has arrived!!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.240
The summoning of a hero is something

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.860
only the kings and lords of the countries...

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.610
...of Flonyald are allowed to do.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.690
This is the first I've seen one!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:14.820
That's right!

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:19.340
That very rare hero
has appeared before us now!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.870
But Princess...

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:29.370
The hero does not know
the rules of our battles, does he?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.960
Will he be alright?

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.190
He'll be fine.

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:37.330
...and Loran is making sure right now.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:42.010
Yes, it looks like you have learned
the rules and routes well.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.280
Yes!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.240
So you were summoned and you met the princess...

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.270
What did you think of her?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.770
She's cute and kind,
I think she's a wonderful princess.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.140
Great!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.990
Now then, Hero, go forth and join Éclair

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:10.000
who is spearheading the battle!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.750
Yes!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.670
Sink Izumi.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.420
Here I come!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.800
Hero-sama, let me go over the rules

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.300
Yes, please!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.190
First, you must defeat all the enemy warriors

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.610
Whoaa! Amazing! He's really a hero!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.160
Wouldn't it be awesome
if we defeated the hero?

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.440
So awesome!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.780
I'll get him!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.920
The enemy warriors will be knocked out if you hit

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.620
them hard with a weapon!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.260
Warriors that have been ruled as knocked out
will

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.490
turn into "animal fur balls"...

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:04.420
...the Lion Army warriors will turn into "cat fur balls"...

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.470
...and will be powerless
for a certain length of time.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.890
I see!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.310
Meow!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.150
Meow?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.910
You can also knock them out by "touching"
your enemy's head...

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.490
...or back with the palm of your hand!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.020
Meo... meow?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.670
Touch outs involve more risk,
so you get

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.570
bonus points for each touch-out!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.360
Meow!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.570
Huh? What? Whaat?

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:11.460
Hah! Ha! He's fast!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:14.200
I'm not really sure what he did!!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.890
The hit score is rising fast!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.130
Could it be, might he turn the fight around?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.310
At any rate, this hero...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.230
Well of course...
He's our hero!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.950
Rebecca... Of course you're going to be

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.570
spending Spring Break with Izumi-kun, right?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.630
What do you mean, of course?

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.350
Really?

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.340
Well our parents are friends, that's all.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.420
I think Izumi-kun's really great.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.220
He's cute and good at sports!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.220
Not really...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.890
He's actually pretty immature.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:17.230
What Sink likes are
athletics and fighting with sticks.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:20.770
It's always about what he's interested in.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:28.320
The battlefield can be on the plains
or in the mountains...

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.530
...but they can also take place in unstable places

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.220
like on suspended bridges and moving surfaces.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.290
But there's no need to worry about falling!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.420
Here's our chance!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.260
Hero, prepare to be defeated!!

00:06:56.010 --> 00:07:00.270
Wow! He's really good!

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.050
Hm, interesting...

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.860
Hmm, why don't I give it a try?

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.960
I know it was the Princess's decision,

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.500
Slash air! Cross!

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.970
Hero Kick!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.070
Hey! I'm Sink Izumi,
and I was summoned as the hero!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.620
Eclair...

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.830
Eclair!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.170
That beam just now, like, was it?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.600
Beam?

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.040
You mean the Seal Cannon?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.290
That's it!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:11.800
This is the Hero's weapon
and the treasure of Biscotti.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.800
The sacred sword, Palladium.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.000
It will change into whatever form you desire.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:19.680
Okay, then a "stick"!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.440
Oh... well that's a pretty simple weapon choice...

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.820
It's fine! Just the right length, too!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.990
Finally, let me tell you about the seal spells.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.680
The seal spells are a technique

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.360
where you collect and use Flonya power...

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:45.000
...that lies in the land
and skies of Flonyald.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.960
Gather the flonya power...

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.000
...to your seal
and mix it with your life power...

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:57.550
You can convert it into spirit energy, like this.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.850
Wow!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:03.230
You can do many different things
with this spirit energy...

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.350
...but the one you are going to use most is

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.780
The Princess told me to learn from you...

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.360
...because you are so good at
handling seal cannons.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.070
Um, I see.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.740
First off, you activate your seal...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.290
Activate seal... Level 1!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.180
Focus all the power and spirit in your body

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.800
Level 2!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.300
Level 3!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.890
Convert the Flonya power to spirit power

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.680
This is the seal cannon!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:17.340
The seal cannon is useful
but it can be warded off...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.730
...by captains and knights that

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.740
are allowed protective gear and armor...

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:21.930
and also...

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.560
When you shoot it, it tires you out!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.180
Think carefully before you use it!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.690
Thanks! I'll do my best!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.500
For a tiny moment there
I was looking forward to a good fight...

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.500
...but it looks like you're nothing
but a servant of the Dog Princess.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.610
Princess Leonmichelli!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.550
Princess?
 On the other side?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.060
I won't have you calling me Princess...

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.610
I am Leonmitchelli Galette de Rois!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.240
King of the Galette Lion Army Territories

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:24.160
Call me your majesty, you insolent fools!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.760
She's here!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:32.290
She's here! Her majesty Leonmitchelli!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.540
She has arrived at the battlefield!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.200
Her trusted Cellkull Doma is here, too!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.680
Enough said, I'll be moving ahead now!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.220
Come on!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.200
Hey...

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.440
Hero... you're in the way! Get off me!

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.190
Uh, hey you're the one...

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.820
Oh, uh, sorry...

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:02.570
You're a girl?

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.120
You...

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.090
you stupid hero!!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.590
Whoa, are they fighting?

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.220
Fire!!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.410
Amazing!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.520
Her Majesty and Doma are moving as one,

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.400
And here comes the hard part!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.000
The Biscotti soldiers are fighting back hard!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.550
Won't be long now
until the final defensive battle.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.260
Will this be where the final showdown takes place?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.050
Run through it, Doma!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.350
Not so fast!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.210
Hero! What's your problem?

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.570
Are you trying to get in the way of the battle?

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:50.140
Hey, you're the one
who got in the way of my aerial!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.150
Lion King Fire seal!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.730
You can do this with seal spells?

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.790
Princess Leo is on a different level!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.520
If you don't want to get defeated...

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.670
...run, now!!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.760
Major big explosion!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.270
What an explosion!
Her Majesty's lethal weapon!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.280
The Lion King Fire seal explosion!

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.700
No one is left standing in range of this fire...

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.490
It's a seal cannon of amazing proportions!

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:58.120
The only issue is that
it knocks out soldiers on the same side!

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.790
That really is something!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.730
Framboise, confirm the situation!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.720
Have I destroyed the hero and Droopy Ears?

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.380
Uh, yes!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.010
Umm, let's see...

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.280
It won't be that easy to beat us!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.060
But isn't this a bit high?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.030
Isn't this a bit too high?

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.270
In the sky?!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.400
The Hero and the Captain
of the Imperial Knights are alright!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:37.120
But they're just sitting
ducks for her majesty!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.720
I don't want to share the glory with you

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:41.720
but we have to work together on this!

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.500
Huh?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.830
We have to cooperate!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.340
The same timing as before,
 this time I won't miss!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.590
Uh, okay!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.290
Good! Get going!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.000
She kicked him!!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.550
Hmm, looks like I underestimated the little guy

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.090
and droopy ears.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.830
We can keep fighting...

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.560
...but I feel like I might be giving

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.230
Your Majesty Leo, you mean...

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:48.730
I hereby surrender.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.510
It can't be, it can't be!
Her Majesty Leo has been defeated!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.740
Bonus points for defeating the enemy leader...

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.520
350 points are added to their score!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.860
The conditions for victory are
Conquering "the base"...

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.960
...so the battle is not over,

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.590
There is almost no way
the Galette side can win now!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.750
Yeah! We did it!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.890
Hero, though you had the help of
the Captain of the Imperial Knights...

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.560
...I applaud you for landing a hit on me!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.360
But don't think you'll be able
 to do the same in the future.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.610
Th, thank you, Prin...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.700
Your Majesty!

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:40.950
Your Majesty!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.330
The battle with your majesty was scary,
but I had fun!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.170
Camera crew, get a close up on Droopy Ears,

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.490
The hero accidentally hit
a knight on his own side!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.030
It went beyond destroying the armor

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.790
Oh my...

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.290
I'll be back!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.550
Next time I'll invade you properly!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.300
Now her majesty
gracefully exits the battleground.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:46.060
That has us all looking forward
to the next invasion!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:51.100
Totally... but this battle isn't over yet!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.390
That's right.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.110
Everyone on the frontlines,
please don't give in until the end!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.660
Keep fighting until we run out of time!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:04.160
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:07.910
I'm sorry! I didn't do it on purpose!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.730
But really, this hero is something!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.090
...but I think he's a little stupid!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.840
Leave me alone!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:21.510
And thank you for the beautiful image
of the Knight Eclair!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.300
Shut up!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.890
Well, if the Galette Army had won...

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:35.730
...we were planning
a local sake festival after this...

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:38.760
If the Biscotti Army wins...

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.430
...the Biscotti side will have

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:42.910
the right to hold the victory event.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:46.580
Yes, Princess Millefiore at Filianno Castle?

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.080
Will the event be...?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.160
Yes, we will provide a night of music

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.630
and song from the Filianno Music Hall.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:58.920
We have the Princess's set list
ready and everything!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:05.300
I didn't now the Princess sang songs?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.680
What do you mean you didn't know!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.690
The Princess is a world-renowned singer!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.940
World-renowned!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.190
That's right!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:20.610
Good job, Hero... Eclair.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.950
When the Princess holds meetings
and interacts with other countries...

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.790
...she brings her music company
and she sings all over the world.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.160
I see...

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.860
Only recently, it's been one battle after another.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:41.200
Even we haven't heard her sing in a while.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:45.130
If you hear her sing,
you'll know what we mean!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:50.180
You've done a great job
so we'll get you the best seat!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.270
Thank you very much!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.160
But um, I'd like to go home once,

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.850
Thanks to our hero,

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.410
That's right...

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:10.660
I wonder if he will stay to hear the concert?

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.770
I don't want him to be too late,

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:17.880
Huh?

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.960
Heroes that are summoned...

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.440
...cannot return to their world

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.760
or even make contact with that world.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.260
That's the rule of the summons.

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:30.850
Once a hero is summoned,
he cannot return to his world!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:35.020
That is why
it is very rare for a hero to be summoned...

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:36.920
You don't mean to say

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.270
You're joking, right...

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:44.150
No, really, I'm not joking.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:47.590
But there must be some way around it right?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.910
No, of course not! There is no way!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.280
Whaaaat!!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.280
Whaaaat!!

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:33.570
You idiot! You pervert Hero!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:35.320
I told you it was an accident!

00:23:35.370 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>I wanna go back!
But I can’t…? A hero in Flonyald</b>

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.720
You! You ought to pay close attention again next time!

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.000
<b></b>
